{
    "title": "3 Tiles - Tile Matching Games",
    "description": "Tile matching games like 3 TILES are a fun and easy way to boost your IQ. Each tile match creates new neural connections. Let our beautiful mahjong keep your mind sharp. Dive into endless entertainment and brain-boosting fun with this tile game!\r\n\r\n<b>Ultimate relaxation kit is always at hand for you</b>\r\n\r\n3 TILES is the best brain puzzle. Like all the matching games, it helps you switch your mind, de-stress, and relax. Long waiting for an appointment or a flight? It won't bother you anymore. You can easily make that time enjoyable with free puzzle games. Match tiles now and you will see how your troubles are fading away and peace will come to your mind. \r\n\r\n3 TILES will remind you of good-old Mahjong from your childhood. We\u2019ve taken the familiar zen match mechanics to a completely new level. Believe, you already know the rules. It will be easy and simple for you to pick up tile push gameplay. At the same time, 3 TILES matching tiles game is exciting, catching, and intriguing to play.\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY TILE MATCHING GAMES\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfaf Your goal is to clear the board. \r\n\ud83e\udde9 Match 3 identical tiles. Just tap to place them into the stack. You are looking for a triple tile match, for instance, three strawberries \ud83c\udf53+\ud83c\udf53+\ud83c\udf53.\r\n\ud83e\udd47 When you clear the board, you win! Keep practicing to become a real tile master 3d one day. \r\n\ud83d\ude30 You get stuck and fail, if you don't get a merge for seven tiles. Remember: You have a maximum of seven moves to make one triple tile match. Each tile connect free all the tile fun\r\n\r\n<b>Matching games for adults are all about having fun</b>\r\n\r\nMatch 3 games can be tricky, but normally, they usually have some similar classic match mechanics. After all, you still need to match tiles and complete your daily challenges, right? This is a pure, relaxing puzzle. Play level after level to make your mind happy. 3 TILES brain puzzle knows how to make you smile.\r\n\r\n3 TILES AMAZING FEATURES:\r\n\ud83c\udf8a Fascinating time-limited events and challenges with unique settings and little marvels for special occasions. Celebrations are always special with our tiles game.\r\n\ud83c\udfa1 Numerous stunning relaxing puzzle themes, from fruits and flowers to space and Wild-Wild West. By the way, if you have a theme idea, feel free to tell us. And your idea will turn into a new, colorful tile collector dream.\r\n\ud83d\uddbc Discover our collections. Each theme in our tile app has a surprise for you. Play and find the hidden parts of a puzzle. Make an exclusive card complete! Also available on time-limited events. \r\n\ud83e\uddda\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Each level for tile busters has a unique distribution on the board that surprises with variety - you have an extremely diverse fun tile matching games\u2019 flow for each new level. Also, look for secret tiles and jokers. Play and find out how they work. \r\n\ud83e\uddd8\u200d\u2640\ufe0f You can play board games the way you like. Whether it\u2019s a fast-paced or a meditative and thoughtful approach like in match games, you\u2019ll find exactly what you want. The tiles game suits all playing styles.\r\n\ud83d\udef0 Offline availability. There is no need to worry about those match games requiring constant Internet or Wi-Fi connection \u2013 you can match tiles offline whenever you want.\r\n\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67\u200d\ud83d\udc66 3 TILES is one of the best memory games for adults. The simple rules and relaxing gameplay mean that anyone can play and enjoy a round of a game. \r\n\r\n3 TILES is one of the unique games that is always there for you. Enjoy catching gameplay, beautiful graphics, and fun challenges. \r\n\r\nStart your tile-matching adventure! Play 3 TILES now  \ud83e\udd70+\ud83e\udd70+\ud83e\udd70\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc9e Get all the latest news about 3 TILES on our official social media pages:\r\n\r\nInstagram \u2714\ufe0f\r\nhttps://www.instagram.com/3tiles_game/\r\n\r\nFacebook \u2714\ufe0f\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/3Tiles.game\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc8c If you have any questions or suggestions, contact our Customer Support by sending an email to info@appsyoulove.com",
